FORMAT: 1A

# 会话代理配置 API

会话代理配置管理 API，用于管理会话中的工具启用状态和 MCP 服务器配置。

# Group 会话代理配置

会话代理配置相关资源。

## 命令执行 [/session_agent_config/command]

执行各种会话代理配置命令的统一入口点。

### 执行命令 [POST]

执行指定的命令，发生异常时自动执行回滚操作。

#### get_tools_enabled_status - 获取工具启用状态

获取会话中指定工具或所有工具的启用状态。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "get_tools_enabled_status",
            "params": {
                "session_id": "session-123",
                "tool_names": ["ask_user_choice", "todo_write"]
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + session_id (string) - 会话 ID
    + tool_names (array[string], optional) - 要查询的工具名称列表，为空表示获取所有工具

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "tools_status": [
                    {
                        "tool_name": "ask_user_choice",
                        "enabled": true
                    },
                    {
                        "tool_name": "todo_write",
                        "enabled": true
                    }
                ],
                "success": true,
                "message": null
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "get_tools_enabled_status",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### update_tools_enabled_status - 更新工具启用状态

更新会话中工具的启用状态。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "update_tools_enabled_status",
            "params": {
                "session_id": "session-123",
                "tools_status": [
                    {
                        "tool_name": "ask_user_choice",
                        "enabled": true
                    },
                    {
                        "tool_name": "todo_write",
                        "enabled": false
                    }
                ]
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + session_id (string) - 会话 ID
    + tools_status (array[object]) - 要更新的工具状态列表
        + tool_name (string) - 工具名称，可用值: `ask_user_choice`, `todo_write`, `read_file`, `edit_file`, `write_file`, `list_directory`
        + enabled (boolean) - 工具是否启用

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "updated_tools": [
                    {
                        "tool_name": "ask_user_choice",
                        "enabled": true
                    },
                    {
                        "tool_name": "todo_write",
                        "enabled": false
                    }
                ],
                "success": true,
                "message": null
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "update_tools_enabled_status",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### get_mcp_servers_config - 获取 MCP 服务器配置

获取会话的 MCP 服务器配置。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "get_mcp_servers_config",
            "params": {
                "session_id": "session-123"
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + session_id (string) - 会话 ID

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "servers": [
                    {
                        "url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "name": "default",
                        "timeout": 30.0,
                        "tool_filter": {
                            "allow_list": null,
                            "deny_list": []
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "success": true,
                "message": null
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "get_mcp_servers_config",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### update_mcp_servers_config - 更新 MCP 服务器配置

更新会话的 MCP 服务器配置。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "update_mcp_servers_config",
            "params": {
                "session_id": "session-123",
                "servers": [
                    {
                        "url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "name": "default",
                        "timeout": 30.0,
                        "tool_filter": {
                            "allow_list": null,
                            "deny_list": []
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + session_id (string) - 会话 ID
    + servers (array[object]) - MCP 服务器配置列表
        + url (string) - MCP Server 的 streamable HTTP URL
        + name (string, optional) - Server 名称，用于日志和错误信息，默认: `default`
        + timeout (number, optional) - 连接和调用超时时间（秒），默认: `30.0`
        + tool_filter (object, optional) - 工具过滤配置
            + allow_list (array[string], optional) - 允许的工具名称列表（白名单），为空则允许所有工具
            + deny_list (array[string], optional) - 禁止的工具名称列表（黑名单）

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "servers": [
                    {
                        "url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "name": "default",
                        "timeout": 30.0,
                        "tool_filter": {
                            "allow_list": null,
                            "deny_list": []
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "success": true,
                "message": null
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "update_mcp_servers_config",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### 通用错误响应

+ Response 404 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "Command unknown_command not found"
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
            "success": false,
            "data": null,
            "error_message": "Input validation failed: ...",
            "command_name": "command_name",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }
